      "id": "macbeth/sceneII_20.4/p@56225",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "OLD MAN.\nThreescore and ten I can remember well,\nWithin the volume of which time I have seen\nHours dreadful and things strange, but this sore night\nHath trifled former knowings.",
